{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026qpPiVD7wyu1795161838.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>長沙灣一座工廈發生火警，兩人不適送院。</p><p></p><p>網上片段見到，大廈中層和天井冒出濃煙，大量黑色的濃煙升上半空。</p><p></p><p>起火的是青山道嘉名工廠大廈7樓，消防和警方事早上近10時半接報，消防到場架起雲梯灌救，工廈內64人自行疏散到地下，調查相信火警由電線短路引起。</p><p></p><p>兩名男子分別因吸入濃煙不適及手背受傷，均送往明愛醫院治理。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T09:16:22.864021+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T08:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T08:37:13.155694+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T09:09:38.399436+00:00","content_hash":"56e7f168c94345aa79dbb8d7521776be6b442b5d3d99c1dc709f857385bca367","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T09:16:22.864021+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}